        this.cells = cells;
    }
}
ReadonlyBox b = new Box(3);
System.out.println(b.size());
What does this program print?

An interface declares a single operation and a variable is given a lambda that must square its argument:
interface Op {
    int apply(int x);
}
Op sq = ____________;
System.out.println(sq.apply(3));
